# Configuration rules

## Brand and URLs come from config

The product is Michicast, under the Michimono brand. Never hardcode `michicast.com` or brand strings in code, views or tests. Read the URL from `APP_URL` via `config('app.url')` and brand values from the application's own config file, so the domain can change without a code change.
